SUMMARY:Accessing the Student Portal
DESCRIPTION:Student Portal (SIS) The Student Portal is the official Student Information System used by Al-Qadisiyah University and all Iraqi universities. It is centrally managed by the Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research.\n🔗 Portal URL: sis.mohesr.gov.iq\nWhat You Can Do in the Portal 📊 View your semester and final grades 📅 See your weekly timetable 📝 Check exam results 📈 Track your cumulative academic record (GPA, credit hours) 💳 View tuition fees and payment receipts 📋 Submit re-examination and study-postponement requests 🎓 Apply for graduation forms and ratification First-Time Login Go to sis.mohesr.gov.iq Use your university ID number as the username (provided by your department) Default password: your university ID + year of birth (you will be prompted to change it on first login) Update your personal information and password Forgot Your Password? Use the &ldquo;Forgot password&rdquo; link inside the portal. If you do not receive a verification email, contact your college&rsquo;s Registration Office.\nLogin Issues? Your college&rsquo;s Registration Office — the first point of contact Central Registrar: registrar@qu.edu.iq Ministry technical support: via the form inside the SIS portal Important Notes The portal is centrally hosted by the Ministry, so you will see ministry branding rather than only QU branding — this is expected Availability may be affected during peak times (registration, results announcements) — try again later Do not share your login credentials with anyone Related Academic Calendar Examination Regulations Student Handbook 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
