SUMMARY:Alumni Affairs
DESCRIPTION:Alumni Affairs Al-Qadisiyah University maintains communication with its graduates and supports them in their professional journey.\nAlumni Services Alumni Database Graduate data registration Contact information updates Career path tracking Employment Opportunities Job announcements from partner companies Annual job fairs Academic recommendations and references Professional Development Workshops and training courses Career counseling programs Continuing education opportunities Certificates and Documents Certificate copies Document authentication Official transcripts Alumni Network Join the Al-Qadisiyah University alumni network to connect with peers and exchange experiences and opportunities.\nEvents Annual alumni gatherings Conferences and seminars Social and sports activities Groups Groups by college/discipline Groups by graduation year Professional sector groups Network Registration To register in the alumni database and join the network:\nComplete the online registration form Attach graduation certificate copy Activate account via email Contact Email: alumni@qu.edu.iq Phone: +964 780 000 0000 (ext. 5555) 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
