SUMMARY:Career Opportunities
DESCRIPTION:Available Career Opportunities Al-Qadisiyah University aims to connect its graduates with the job market by publishing available employment opportunities.\nCurrent Job Announcements Government Positions Organization Position Required Major Deadline Ministry of Health Resident Physician General Medicine 2026/02/28 Ministry of Education Secondary Teacher Science, Mathematics 2026/03/15 Ministry of Higher Education Teaching Assistant All Majors Open Private Sector Positions Company Position Required Major Deadline Tech Company Software Developer Computer Science 2026/02/15 Private Hospital Pharmacist Pharmacy 2026/02/20 Engineering Firm Civil Engineer Civil Engineering 2026/03/01 Training Programs Summer Training Program The university, in cooperation with the private sector, offers summer training programs for students including:\nTraining in government institutions Training in private companies Professional workshops Career Counseling Program Individual counseling sessions Resume writing workshops Job interview simulations For Companies and Employers Post a Job Announcement Companies and institutions can post job announcements via:\nEmail: jobs@qu.edu.iq Phone: +964 780 000 0000 Employer Satisfaction Survey We welcome your feedback on our graduates to improve our academic programs.\nComplete Employer Survey\nUseful Links Government Employment Portal (External link) Mihanti Platform (External link) Alumni Network 
