DESCRIPTION:Honor Roll for Academic Year 2024-2025 We are proud of our outstanding students who have achieved academic excellence across various colleges.\nTop Students University-Wide First Stage Rank Name College GPA 1 Ahmed Mohammed Ali College of Medicine 96.5% 2 Fatima Hussein Kareem College of Pharmacy 95.8% 3 Ali Abdullah Hassan College of Engineering 95.2% Final Stage Rank Name College GPA 1 Zainab Ahmed Mohammed College of Medicine 94.7% 2 Mohammed Saeed Jasim College of Dentistry 93.9% 3 Noor Ali Kadhim College of Engineering 93.5% Top Students by College College of Medicine First: Zainab Ahmed Mohammed - 94.7% Second: Ahmed Ali Hussein - 93.2% Third: Sarah Mohammed Abdullah - 92.8% College of Engineering First: Noor Ali Kadhim - 93.5% Second: Hussein Mohammed Ahmed - 92.1% Third: Yasmin Saeed Kareem - 91.7% College of Science First: Maryam Hassan Ali - 92.3% Second: Omar Ahmed Mohammed - 91.5% Third: Ruqaya Ali Hussein - 90.8% College of Computer Science First: Ali Mohammed Kadhim - 94.1% Second: Huda Saeed Ahmed - 93.3% Third: Hussein Ali Jasim - 92.6% Excellence Recognition Program The university offers outstanding students:\n🏆 Certificates of appreciation 💰 Financial rewards 📚 Postgraduate scholarships 🎓 Opportunities to participate in scientific conferences 💼 Employment priority Honor Roll Criteria Achieve 85% or higher GPA No failing grades in any subject Excellent academic conduct Participation in university activities Honor Roll Archive Honor Roll 2023-2024 Honor Roll 2022-2023 Honor Roll 2021-2022 
