SUMMARY:Study in Iraq
DESCRIPTION:Study in Iraq Program Al-Qadisiyah University welcomes international students from around the world to study in its diverse academic programs.\nWhy Al-Qadisiyah University? Quality Education: Accredited and advanced academic programs Affordable Tuition: Compared to regional universities Rich Cultural Environment: Opportunity to learn about Iraq&rsquo;s ancient civilization Strategic Location: In the heart of Iraq with easy access Programs for International Students Bachelor&rsquo;s Programs Human Medicine (6 years) Dentistry (5 years) Pharmacy (5 years) Engineering (4 years) Sciences (4 years) Graduate Programs Master&rsquo;s in various disciplines PhD in various disciplines Admission Requirements High school certificate or equivalent Certificate equivalency from relevant authorities Proof of language proficiency (Arabic or English) Meeting program-specific requirements Application Steps Online Registration: Through Study in Iraq website Upload Documents: Required certificates and documents Pay Application Fee: Through electronic portal Await Admission: Application review and results announcement Visa Issuance: After final admission Costs and Fees Fees vary by program and specialization. For detailed fees:\nVisit Study in Iraq\nContact Email: international@qu.edu.iq Phone: +964 780 000 0000 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
